      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Hemangiomas of the nasal cavity and especially paranasal sinuses are very rare. Authors reported a case of hemangioma cavernous of the nasal cavity and maxillary sinus in a 34-year-old women. Diagnostic procedures, therapeutic intervention were presented and literature reviewed."},
